      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cornell%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cornell is home to the world's only surviving stationary pulpwood stacker, which helped launch the regional timber industry.",
